    "title": "Lincoln County Sheriff's Office: 2 arrests - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sheriff Todd Brackett ,\n1 days ago The Lincoln County Sheriff’s Office responded to 281 calls for service for the period of Dec. 9 to Dec. 16. Year to date, LCSO has responded to 13,912 calls for service. Thomas J. Hansen, 25, of Wiscasset was arrested Dec. 14 for Domestic Violence Criminal Mischief, on Gardiner Road, Dresden, by Deputy Nathaniel Aronson. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
